        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "Appeal from an order of the Supreme Court (McDonough, J.), entered March 21, 2012 in Rensselaer County, which granted defendant’s motion for summary judgment dismissing the complaint.",
        "statement_status": "procedural_history"
